      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of detachment is a sign you're not alone, and it's okay to let go of the weight of trying to understand who you are right now. Sometimes, when the world feels too distant, the only way to find your true self is to step away from it all and let the silence take over. You don't need to figure everything out today; just focus on the small, immediate things like breathing or resting, and trust that the fog will lift eventually.",
